  - id: south
    label: Koi pond + bridge line
    identity: 'Horizontal grey / blue-green: three dark water planes ringed by pale
      rim stone, the 1.45 m bridge as a thin dark band at x=4, light gravel shore
      paths on routes 21/22, rocks and low greens - the only wet region'
    sightlineClass: medium
    polygonXZ:
