    - 45
    - -37.5
    - 13.5
    - -13.5
  - id: west
    label: Bamboo garden + closed corridor
    identity: 'Vertical green rhythm: culm verticals over a dark-wood / grey-roof
      corridor band; sparse ground, open-lattice fences on the boundaries, the shortest
      sightlines on the map'
